== Example A: a river valley (hired mode, contract) ==
travel time upper to lower k = ceil(60 / 30)                   2
haul units per carrying unit s = ceil(60 / 10)                 6
lag of the news from lower to upper = 1 + ceil(70 / 40)        3
fuel per carrying unit = min(1200 / 2, 900 / 6)                150
carrying units for a lot of 150 fuel                           1
rumour (price 310, mean 305, source age 0): Rhat = min         305
hired: Rnet = Rhat * (10 000 - 500) / 10 000, floor            289
local fuel price Pacq                                          200
freight Cm = n * s * 700                                       4200
gross margin G = 150 * (289 - 200)                             13350
  agent 32: u =  7770 bp, share phi =  6385 bp, test Cm*10000 <= phi*G: True, per haul unit 2225, haul bid ceiling 1420, break-even buy 245, offer limit 244
  agent 33: u =  3951 bp, share phi =  4476 bp, test Cm*10000 <= phi*G: True, per haul unit 2225, haul bid ceiling 995, break-even buy 226, offer limit 263
  agent 34: u =   131 bp, share phi =  2566 bp, test Cm*10000 <= phi*G: False, per haul unit 2225, haul bid ceiling 570, break-even buy 179, offer limit 310
  agent 35: u =  6311 bp, share phi =  5655 bp, test Cm*10000 <= phi*G: True, per haul unit 2225, haul bid ceiling 1258, break-even buy 239, offer limit 250
agent 32: offer limit L                                        244
consignee: take limit b = 300 * (10 000 - 1 000) / 10 000      270
contract price = midpoint half to even of (L + b) / 2          257
escrow = price * 150                                           38550
deliverer outcome: escrow - 150 * 205 - freight                3600

A perishable on the same lane (ShelfLife 3): fresh lot bought at t, shipped at t + 1 (age 1)
