lag of the news from pit to hub = 1 + ceil(250 / 100)          4
rations per carrying unit                                      1500
lot affordable: floor((6 000 - 3 * 35) / 58)                   101
wear: ceil(5 * 3 * 4 000 / 400)                                150
feed: 1 * 1 * 3 cells at 30                                    90
time: 3 * (1 * 56) * 10 000 / 10 000                           168
trip cost Cs                                                   408
gross margin G = 100 * (78 - 56)                               2200
agent 18: u, phi                                               1246, 3123
test Cs * 10 000 <= phi * G                                    4080000 <= 6870600: True
break-even buy price                                           64
share of the gross margin the trip costs, bp                   1854

